{"v":"v44","content":"<h1><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; font-weight: normal;\"><font style=\"font-size: 23px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 29px;\">RooiKappie</span></font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h1><div><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; font-weight: normal;\"><font style=\"font-size: 23px;\"><br></font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h1><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; font-weight: normal;\"><font style=\"font-size: 23px;\">RooiKappie, stap die dans vloer binne met haar rooi skoene blink en vyn</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h1><div><font style=\"font-size: 23px;\">Sy glimlag breed, sy swaai haar lyfie vanaand behoor die aand net aan haar alleen</font></div><div><font style=\"font-size: 23px;\">Die ligte fliks so oor h<span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><font style=\"\">aar rooikap, die mense draai hul</font></span></span></span></span></span></span>le koppe saam</font></div><div><font style=\"font-size: 23px;\">Wolfie staan still by die kroek en staar, maar RooiKappie dans net aan en aan</font></div><div><font style=\"font-size: 23px;\"><br></font></div><div><font style=\"font-size: 23px;\">Vat my hand, kom draai my rond, laat die vas dans klop tot op die grond</font></div><div><font style=\"font-size: 23px;\">Rooi skoene tik tik op die vloer, die rikme voel ek tot my ker en deer</font></div><div><font style=\"font-size: 23px;\"><br></font></div><div><font style=\"font-size: 23px;\">RooiKappie met her roos skoene, draai my nader laat my spoeg laat my loer</font></div><div><font style=\"font-size: 23px;\">Skid daai rooi kap laat hom sorg, vanaand vat sy my hart sommer klaar</font></div><div><font style=\"font-size: 23px;\">Rooi skoene wat die nag laat sing, trap daai vir vas dans kring</font></div><div><font style=\"font-size: 23px;\">Sy is die meisie me mooiste doef, RooiKappie laat die dans vloer beweeg</font></div><div><font style=\"font-size: 23px;\"><br></font></div><div><font style=\"font-size: 23px;\">Wolfie vra sag maag ek net een dans, maar sy se jammer ek het reeds my kaans</font></div><div><font style=\"font-size: 23px;\">Sy draai weg en gee haar knipoog vyn, want sy weet presies hoe sy wil skyn</font></div><div><font style=\"font-size: 23px;\">Elke draai laat daai kappie swaai, haar roos skoen vang die lig so vry</font></div><div><font style=\"font-size: 23px;\">Die bos vergeet van sy donker stories, van navond is net rukme liefde en glories</font></div><div><font style=\"font-size: 23px;\"><br></font></div><div><font style=\"font-size: 23px;\">Rooi skoen glad die musik word stadig, sy trek my nader, die oomblik magies</font></div><div><font style=\"font-size: 23px;\">Dan bou die klank weer, die bus kom terug, hou vas my maat hier kom die sug</font></div><div><font style=\"font-size: 23px;\"><br></font></div><div><font style=\"font-size: 23px;\">RooiKappie met haar roos skoen, vas die may ons twee raak soos een</font></div><div><font style=\"font-size: 23px;\">Skid daai rooi kap laat die rukme waai, trek my nader hou my styf vas vanaand</font></div><div><font style=\"font-size: 23px;\">Rooi skoene dans me son op roep, RooiKappie maak die wereld soet</font></div><div><font style=\"font-size: 23px;\">Sy draai n lag, n droome rooi, en ek vasdans saam met los haar nooit</font></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div>"}